            },
            "reviewBody": "Surprisingly excellent - tastes very much like Guacamole minus the calories!\r\nI would use less garlic next time an dadd cayenne pepper to spice it up."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
