            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lisa"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I omitted the hot sauce because I didn't have any in the house and because my 91 year old dad probably wouldn't enjoy it. I think the taste was pretty good. I used a head of broccoli and three small avocados. It is sitting in the fridge waiting for tonight (New Years Eve) and I might add a little more salt just before I serve it.",
            "datePublished": "2015-12-31T12:22:38.683Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MTCHYG"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very good an healthy alternative. Love the zing from the garlic and onion. Next time I'll add more hot sauce (though I tend to like A LOT of hot sauce).",
            "datePublished": "2010-09-16T09:25:10.520Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Leah2974"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Surprisingly really good. Great idea. I did NOT use a whole head of broccoli. More like half. The hard part was chopping up the steamed broccoli because I didn't use a food processor.",
            "datePublished": "2010-07-04T14:52:00.787Z"
          },
          {
